{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "mcp-excalidraw-server",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "w_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "07-17, end to end: one trade with the flip as its hinge",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_sub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 68,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Twenty-two minutes of tape. The POC flips at 06:07 and he does not buy until 11:50 — everything in between is the gate doing its job.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_b1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Price is outside the JBA low and the\novernight low, building a fresh node down\nin the 310s.\n\nThe previous POC is way above:\n\"the previous PAC was set at 410 right\nup here, 100 points above.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_t1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 158,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "1 · @01:55   the setup",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_b2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"If we have an exhaustive look, we flip\nand we have accommodation from the\nopponent, which would be the offer.\nAnd so pock flips down.\"\n\nThe crowd has relocated to the low end.\nLongs are now the side he can look at.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_t2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 158,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "2 · @06:07   the gate opens",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_b3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"we still have unfinished business at the\nbottom of that volume profile. We don't\nhave either a parabolic taper. We don't\nhave an exhaustive node. Pock has\nshifted down. So now this invites the\nopportunity...\"    Same breath: \"there's\nno reason for me to have my eyes on the dom.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_t3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 830,
      "y": 158,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "3 · @07:16   and he does not buy",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.985Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_b4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 450,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "A lower distribution builds; the 87s are its\nupper edge. Only now does he look:\n\n\"I have no concern looking at the DOM\nwith the exception of the 87s.\"\n→ \"the red pulsing in, pulsing in\" (@09:47)\n→ \"It's all blue right now. The blue means\n   it's pulled off.\"  (@11:25)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.986Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.986Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_t4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 418,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "4 · @09:29–@11:25   now the DOM",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.986Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.986Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_b5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 450,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "\"shortly after this is where I mentioned to\nthe group, hey, you know, with the pock\nflip and so forth, I'm engaging.\"\n\nConfirmed a minute later (@12:41): \"The\noffer is off the 87s. You see the stacking\nthere at the 84s... strength from the bid\nside and weakness from the offer.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.987Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.987Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w_t5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 418,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "5 · @11:50   in",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.987Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:50:21.987Z",
      "version": 1
    },
